WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:08.920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:35.080 --> 01:38.920
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:43.160 --> 01:44.280
Deadly trials?

01:44.880 --> 01:46.360
What if she can't get through it?

01:46.440 --> 01:48.480
Bloodshed and death hang over her.

01:49.080 --> 01:50.640
If she cannot get through it,

01:50.720 --> 01:53.440
then I'm afraid
her death is fast approaching.

01:53.520 --> 01:56.480
She will not live past her twenties.

01:57.520 --> 01:58.480
How dare you!

01:58.560 --> 02:00.320
How dare you curse my daughter?

02:00.400 --> 02:01.680
Yi Jiang,

02:01.760 --> 02:02.720
how dare you speak such nonsense?

02:02.800 --> 02:04.400
Apologize to Her Ladyship at once.

02:06.560 --> 02:07.480
I spoke frankly.

02:08.160 --> 02:09.120
Please forgive me, Your Ladyship.

02:10.160 --> 02:11.160
It's nothing.

02:12.480 --> 02:15.800
Nuwa and Fuxi
wanted to take me to paradise.

02:15.880 --> 02:17.240
I told them I wouldn't go.

02:17.320 --> 02:19.400
I have another 80 years to live.

02:20.680 --> 02:24.240
Yi Jiang,
watch closely and see for yourself.

02:24.800 --> 02:26.600
I won't settle for even one day less.

02:26.680 --> 02:29.520
I spoke out of turn.
Please forgive me, Your Ladyship.

02:30.800 --> 02:34.400
Fortune-telling is just for fun.

02:34.480 --> 02:36.880
You needn't take it to heart.

02:38.400 --> 02:40.880
Hualou, is your painting finished?

02:46.560 --> 02:48.160
Lady Zheng, it's finished.

02:53.440 --> 02:56.280
No wonder you're famed
throughout the capital for your talent.

02:56.360 --> 02:59.040
It really captures the spirit,

02:59.120 --> 03:00.240
remarkably so.

03:00.840 --> 03:02.240
Attendants, reward her.

03:03.480 --> 03:04.520
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

03:04.600 --> 03:05.880
AUSPICIOUS DAYS, JOYOUS GATHERINGS

03:05.960 --> 03:09.040
I invited Noble Lady Wu'an here today
to discuss another important matter.

03:11.120 --> 03:14.480
The Crown Prince is
nearly 30 and still childless.

03:15.000 --> 03:19.400
I hear your foster sister
is gentle and virtuous.

03:19.480 --> 03:21.880
I'd like her to become
the Crown Prince's secondary consort,

03:21.960 --> 03:25.640
so she may bear him children
and continue his line.

03:26.160 --> 03:30.320
Your Ladyship, what do you think?

03:31.880 --> 03:34.920
My sister cannot speak.
I'm afraid she cannot serve His Highness.

03:35.600 --> 03:37.400
Hongxian wasn't born mute.

03:38.640 --> 03:40.320
After some treatment
from the imperial physicians,

03:40.400 --> 03:41.440
she'll recover.

03:42.720 --> 03:43.640
Hongxian,

03:44.480 --> 03:45.760
your sister can't bear to part with you.

03:47.480 --> 03:48.960
But you mustn't be ungrateful.

03:49.880 --> 03:50.880
Come now.

03:50.960 --> 03:52.560
Thank Lady Zheng for this honor.

03:56.480 --> 03:57.320
Lady Zheng,

03:58.960 --> 04:00.240
Hongxian is already betrothed.

04:03.240 --> 04:05.360
Who would dare
offend the heir to the throne?

04:05.440 --> 04:06.840
Have him call off the engagement.

04:07.920 --> 04:08.840
Good girl,

04:10.280 --> 04:11.560
it's time to give thanks.

04:12.640 --> 04:13.520
Go on.

04:21.160 --> 04:22.200
Stop!

04:23.920 --> 04:25.400
I won't allow it!

04:25.480 --> 04:27.080
Noble Lady Wu'an,

04:27.600 --> 04:30.240
an imperial offer of marriage
cannot be refused.

04:30.320 --> 04:31.880
Do you plan to defy imperial authority

04:31.960 --> 04:33.920
for a girl of common birth?

04:35.080 --> 04:36.440
Lady Zheng,

04:36.520 --> 04:38.200
Rao and Hongxian share a deep bond.

04:39.200 --> 04:40.600
Rao has settled Hongxian's marriage.

04:40.680 --> 04:42.680
Why put her in such a difficult position

04:42.760 --> 04:43.960
by insisting on taking her as a consort?

04:44.560 --> 04:45.920
Because the Crown Prince
has taken a fancy to her

04:46.520 --> 04:47.720
and insists on taking her as a consort.

04:49.200 --> 04:50.320
Hualou,

04:51.040 --> 04:52.520
if the Crown Prince
wanted you as his consort,

04:52.600 --> 04:54.240
how would you react?

04:55.600 --> 04:56.600
I would simply obey.

04:57.480 --> 04:58.600
Did you hear that?

04:58.680 --> 05:00.560
When a man of higher
rank wants a lowborn woman,

05:00.640 --> 05:02.840
she must simply obey.

05:02.920 --> 05:04.880
Even if you take this to His Majesty,

05:04.960 --> 05:08.560
His Majesty will never permit anyone
to defy their betters

05:08.640 --> 05:09.880
and disobey the imperial family.

05:09.960 --> 05:11.280
That is the law.

05:11.360 --> 05:13.000
That is propriety.

05:33.680 --> 05:35.200
I wouldn't dare offend you.

05:37.520 --> 05:38.760
Please forgive me, Your Ladyship.

05:44.480 --> 05:45.920
Noble Lady Wu'an,

05:47.320 --> 05:49.120
at least you know how to behave.

05:54.560 --> 05:56.600
I have something to tell Your Ladyship.

05:56.680 --> 05:59.120
May I come closer to speak?

06:09.480 --> 06:12.560
A mother rises in status through her son.

06:13.720 --> 06:17.680
The mother of the Crown Prince
is traditionally made Empress.

06:18.640 --> 06:20.960
Yet you still
haven't been given that title.

06:22.320 --> 06:25.080
So who are you to act
like you're already Empress?

06:25.960 --> 06:26.800
How dare you!

06:31.440 --> 06:32.160
Rao!

06:34.520 --> 06:35.480
Rao!

06:36.160 --> 06:37.080
You…

06:38.920 --> 06:42.240
What have I done to offend Your Ladyship
that you had to strike me like that?

06:43.480 --> 06:44.520
I… I didn't even…

06:44.600 --> 06:47.080
You vile woman!
How dare you hurt my daughter?

06:49.320 --> 06:50.320
How dare you hit me?

06:52.960 --> 06:54.000
Mother!

06:55.520 --> 06:56.600
Stop!

06:56.680 --> 06:58.120
-Stop!
-Mother.

07:00.640 --> 07:02.280
What is all this racket?

07:09.080 --> 07:10.080
Greetings, Your Majesty.

07:16.680 --> 07:18.120
Your Majesty,

07:18.200 --> 07:20.280
Lady Zheng attacked
my daughter without cause.

07:20.360 --> 07:23.440
I beg Your Majesty for justice.

07:23.520 --> 07:25.240
Did this really happen?

07:26.760 --> 07:28.040
Come on. Get up.

07:28.800 --> 07:30.480
All of you, rise.

07:35.040 --> 07:36.080
Your Majesty,

07:36.600 --> 07:38.800
the Crown Prince has taken a liking
to Noble Lady Wu'an's foster sister

07:38.880 --> 07:40.000
and wishes to take
her as a secondary consort.

07:40.680 --> 07:42.640
Lady Zheng kindly offered
to arrange the match, but she…

07:42.720 --> 07:44.280
Your Majesty,

07:44.360 --> 07:48.320
Wu'an spoke insolently and humiliated me.

07:48.400 --> 07:51.680
All I did was tell Lady Zheng
that Hongxian was already betrothed,

07:52.480 --> 07:53.920
and she slapped me.

07:55.120 --> 07:56.200
I've been wronged.

07:56.720 --> 07:58.160
I beg Your Majesty to judge fairly.

07:58.240 --> 08:00.680
-You clearly said…
-Said what?

08:05.880 --> 08:09.280
Lady Wang heard our conversation.

08:10.840 --> 08:12.360
Lady Wang, please tell us what you heard.

08:16.600 --> 08:17.680
Your Majesty,

08:18.920 --> 08:20.080
I was present.

08:20.680 --> 08:22.280
I certainly

08:24.560 --> 08:26.120
didn't hear anything offensive.

08:27.000 --> 08:28.720
For reasons I don't know,

08:28.800 --> 08:30.120
Lady Zheng lost her temper

08:30.200 --> 08:32.159
and struck
Noble Lady Wu'an on the right cheek.

08:32.240 --> 08:35.200
Xie Hualou, you were there too.

08:35.280 --> 08:36.720
Please tell us the truth.

08:38.039 --> 08:39.280
I…

08:42.880 --> 08:45.000
I couldn't hear clearly.

08:47.320 --> 08:50.680
What exactly have I done wrong?
Please do let me know, Lady Zheng.

08:51.520 --> 08:52.480
You…

08:57.040 --> 08:58.160
Your Majesty,

08:58.760 --> 09:01.240
all I said was that a mother's status
rises with her son's.

09:01.840 --> 09:03.840
-The Crown Prince…
-A mother's status rises with her son's.

09:04.440 --> 09:07.320
Once Hongxian enters the Crown Prince's
household and bears a child,

09:08.160 --> 09:10.400
His Majesty will reward her handsomely.

09:10.480 --> 09:12.680
Noble Lady Wu'an
will share in that honor too.

09:12.760 --> 09:15.040
What's wrong with that?

09:17.480 --> 09:20.160
The Crown Prince has taken
a fancy to Wu'an's foster sister?

09:20.240 --> 09:21.080
Where is she?

09:29.320 --> 09:30.320
Raise your head.

09:41.680 --> 09:43.360
Your Majesty, my sister is already…

09:45.520 --> 09:46.360
Father, forgive me.

09:46.960 --> 09:48.040
This happened because of me.

09:48.640 --> 09:49.880
It's entirely my fault.

09:50.480 --> 09:52.960
I often visit my sister,
and I've long had my eye on Hongxian.

09:54.360 --> 09:56.560
But since I haven't
taken a principal wife,

09:57.080 --> 10:00.240
my sister feared
you'd think me young and reckless.

10:00.320 --> 10:03.240
So she did all she could to conceal it
and dared not comply.

10:05.880 --> 10:08.680
Oh, you. That really was unacceptable.

10:09.280 --> 10:11.160
How could you let
your sister take the blame?

10:12.800 --> 10:13.760
Your Majesty,

10:14.360 --> 10:15.720
well…

10:17.360 --> 10:18.560
You little rascal.

10:19.160 --> 10:21.480
You're reckless and out of control.

10:22.240 --> 10:26.120
From now on, discipline yourself
and conduct yourself with dignity.

10:26.200 --> 10:28.440
If you get out of line again,

10:28.520 --> 10:30.240
I won't let you off lightly.

10:31.760 --> 10:32.880
Yes.

10:33.520 --> 10:35.520
As for this girl…

10:37.760 --> 10:39.040
Your Majesty…

10:40.360 --> 10:43.520
The Crown Prince
should cherish his brothers

10:43.600 --> 10:44.560
and treat them with courtesy.

10:45.280 --> 10:47.160
only then can he be a model for the realm.

10:48.680 --> 10:49.920
It's only one woman.

10:50.000 --> 10:52.880
Find him another suitable girl.

10:54.280 --> 10:55.360
And you.

10:56.200 --> 10:59.200
If your daughter has been wronged,
come to me for a fair judgment.

10:59.280 --> 11:01.440
You shouldn't have acted rashly

11:02.040 --> 11:03.920
and disgraced the imperial family.

11:04.960 --> 11:06.120
Your punishment…

11:09.480 --> 11:11.480
Both of you were at fault.

11:11.560 --> 11:13.000
You'll each lose a year's allowance

11:13.600 --> 11:15.880
and remain in
your palace for a month to reflect.

11:17.520 --> 11:18.720
Your Majesty is wise.

11:37.920 --> 11:40.480
Was everything you said
at the banquet true?

11:41.160 --> 11:44.000
Noble Lady Wu'an's
features foretell a noble destiny.

11:44.520 --> 11:45.600
No, more than that.

11:46.240 --> 11:49.200
Her authority will grow,
and the people will rally to her.

11:49.280 --> 11:51.480
Wherever she directs her banner,
none will dare disobey.

11:51.560 --> 11:53.840
Even the reigning Empress Dowager

11:53.920 --> 11:55.640
doesn't have features like hers.

11:56.760 --> 11:59.240
But her ear rims turn outward,

11:59.760 --> 12:01.200
and she has a fiery temper.

12:01.720 --> 12:04.320
A flame that burns too
fiercely consumes its wick.

12:04.840 --> 12:06.920
How can a candle like
that last long in the wind?

12:07.520 --> 12:11.640
The fiercer the flame,
the sooner it burns out.

12:12.800 --> 12:14.520
She may enjoy great glory for a time,

12:14.600 --> 12:16.720
but will never see past
her blossoming years.

12:17.360 --> 12:18.680
Exactly.

12:19.760 --> 12:21.640
The Crown Prince wanted a common girl.

12:21.720 --> 12:23.760
She should have let him have her.
But she refused.

12:24.800 --> 12:26.240
She's rebellious by nature.

12:27.880 --> 12:30.360
Now that you've seen her for yourself,
I can rest easy.

12:30.960 --> 12:32.320
Marked for an early death

12:33.280 --> 12:34.800
with the makings of a tyrant.

12:35.920 --> 12:38.160
And she's a woman, no less.

12:38.840 --> 12:40.040
What a pity.

12:40.880 --> 12:42.240
SILKS AND FINE FABRICS

12:42.320 --> 12:43.560
Hualou, please don't be angry.

12:43.640 --> 12:45.880
I have a few things to say.
I'll leave once I've said them.

12:46.680 --> 12:48.560
Grand Tutor Xie
enjoys an honorable reputation,

12:48.640 --> 12:50.400
but your father holds
only the rank of viscount.

12:50.920 --> 12:53.200
I'll ask Father to make him a marquis,

12:53.920 --> 12:56.000
give 3000 jin of gold as a betrothal gift,

12:56.080 --> 12:58.160
and expand the Xie family's
fief by a hundred li.

12:58.960 --> 13:00.520
You truly want to marry me?

13:01.240 --> 13:02.640
Then why did you ask for Hongxian?

13:04.640 --> 13:06.000
Only to save her.

13:07.160 --> 13:08.600
You come from a distinguished family,

13:08.680 --> 13:10.920
act with sound judgment,
and carry yourself with grace.

13:11.000 --> 13:13.840
Surely you can see
beyond petty matters of love, right?

13:16.520 --> 13:18.680
You can take as
many concubines as you like.

13:19.400 --> 13:20.240
It's just…

13:20.320 --> 13:22.840
what if Hongxian becomes another Yi Jiang,

13:23.640 --> 13:24.880
and you lose your head over her one day…

13:29.160 --> 13:30.720
I'm not Prince Fu.

13:31.400 --> 13:33.800
By custom, an emperor's son
who takes a principal wife

13:33.880 --> 13:34.720
can be granted a princely title.

13:35.320 --> 13:36.680
You'll have the status of a prince's wife,

13:36.760 --> 13:38.520
with all the honor
and dignity that entails.

13:39.120 --> 13:41.240
I'll cherish you
and treat you well for life.

13:41.320 --> 13:42.400
No other woman
will take precedence over you.

13:43.000 --> 13:44.120
There.

13:44.200 --> 13:46.080
I've said what I came to say.

13:46.160 --> 13:47.240
Please, think this through.

13:48.760 --> 13:49.920
Stop the carriage!

13:51.760 --> 13:52.880
Wait.

13:56.800 --> 14:00.400
Alert your sister to be careful
with the Crown Princess.

14:00.920 --> 14:02.920
She's been in contact with
some of the displaced from Ancheng.

14:05.120 --> 14:06.000
All right.

14:06.520 --> 14:07.960
Once I've spoken to Father,

14:08.040 --> 14:09.200
I'll visit your family at
once to ask for your hand.

14:21.400 --> 14:24.160
SONGYUE HALL

14:24.240 --> 14:26.240
-My Lord.
-Has Her Ladyship returned?

14:26.760 --> 14:29.160
She has, but…

14:29.240 --> 14:30.400
What's wrong?

14:49.120 --> 14:50.320
Finished with military business?

14:52.720 --> 14:54.840
I came back early
after inspecting the troops.

14:57.440 --> 14:58.880
What happened at the palace?

15:00.520 --> 15:01.600
Nothing much.

15:02.200 --> 15:05.320
Prince Fu's favorite concubine,
Yi Jiang, who is skilled at reading faces,

15:05.840 --> 15:06.840
said I would face trials.

15:07.680 --> 15:09.520
All that mystical nonsense
and fearmongering

15:09.600 --> 15:10.800
was quite upsetting.

15:13.560 --> 15:14.720
Is that what she said?

15:15.560 --> 15:16.400
What else did she say?

15:17.560 --> 15:19.000
Is Yi Jiang really that accurate?

15:19.600 --> 15:21.000
Prince Fu dotes on her.

15:21.520 --> 15:24.520
His travel dates,
clothes, carriages, and routes

15:24.600 --> 15:25.800
all depend on her divinations.

15:28.120 --> 15:29.800
He treats her like a fortune-teller.

15:30.480 --> 15:31.920
Prince Fu really is foolish.

15:32.000 --> 15:33.480
No wonder Xie Hualou wouldn't marry him.

15:33.560 --> 15:35.200
He isn't foolish.

15:35.880 --> 15:37.360
Yi Jiang must have
some extraordinary ability.

15:40.720 --> 15:41.560
Starting tomorrow,

15:42.200 --> 15:43.640
take Zhao Song and
Zhao Bai whenever you go out.

15:44.640 --> 15:45.680
You believe her too?

15:45.760 --> 15:47.480
Your safety is at stake.

15:48.000 --> 15:50.280
I'd rather take the warning seriously.
It's settled.

15:54.200 --> 15:55.960
My Lord, you have a visitor.

15:57.480 --> 15:58.320
Who's here?

15:59.720 --> 16:00.840
It's probably military business.

16:01.720 --> 16:02.560
I'll be right back.

16:12.880 --> 16:14.040
Aman.

16:21.360 --> 16:22.520
Pack some valuables and money.

16:23.040 --> 16:23.880
At the Zi hour tonight…

16:43.600 --> 16:45.440
I've arranged a place for you to hide.

16:45.520 --> 16:46.840
Xiao will be waiting there.

16:46.920 --> 16:48.520
You'll leave the city at the Yin hour.

16:50.680 --> 16:51.600
Don't ask questions.

16:52.200 --> 16:53.280
Get in the carriage.

16:55.120 --> 16:56.280
Hurry.

17:01.560 --> 17:02.360
Don't move.

17:02.440 --> 17:03.760
Stop!

17:06.240 --> 17:07.400
Zhao Bai, put away your sword.

17:08.640 --> 17:10.000
Hongxian, get in.

17:10.920 --> 17:12.240
His Majesty has approved.

17:12.319 --> 17:14.200
Hongxian must marry the Fourth Prince.

17:15.440 --> 17:16.520
Otherwise, if the truth comes out later,

17:17.119 --> 17:19.400
Lady Li and Liu Shuo
will both be implicated.

17:20.880 --> 17:22.319
Don't worry about that. Get in.

17:26.760 --> 17:28.000
Why won't you listen?

17:28.079 --> 17:29.360
I'm telling you to leave!

17:29.440 --> 17:30.520
Wei Rao!

17:36.520 --> 17:37.560
Fine.

17:38.720 --> 17:40.160
Have it your way.

17:41.160 --> 17:42.440
I'm done looking after you.

18:14.880 --> 18:17.920
We're not related by blood,
yet you've caused me so much trouble.

18:18.000 --> 18:19.600
I should never have meddled.

18:20.360 --> 18:21.880
I should have sent you away long ago.

18:23.000 --> 18:25.400
From now on, I won't concern myself
whether you live or die,

18:37.440 --> 18:40.480
Liu Shuo will take a wife
from a suitable noble family.

18:41.160 --> 18:43.760
Even if he favors you for my sake,

18:43.840 --> 18:46.000
you'll still be a lowly concubine.

18:46.680 --> 18:48.280
Think of Madam Ge in the tenement.

18:49.240 --> 18:50.840
Simply because of her beautiful eyes,

18:51.440 --> 18:54.000
the principal wife grew jealous
and blinded her.

18:55.600 --> 18:58.640
You can't even cry out in pain.
How can I possibly not worry?

19:02.320 --> 19:05.720
You worked yourself to
the bone to feed our family.

19:05.800 --> 19:09.800
I always thought that once I grew up,

19:10.400 --> 19:12.080
I'd be willing to become a concubine,

19:12.840 --> 19:14.600
even a slave or a prostitute,

19:14.680 --> 19:18.200
so you wouldn't
have to work so hard again.

19:19.040 --> 19:20.120
Hongxian…

19:20.720 --> 19:22.400
As a prince's concubine,

19:24.160 --> 19:25.160
I won't go hungry again.

19:26.240 --> 19:27.160
That's a good thing.

19:28.280 --> 19:29.440
I don't want to leave.

19:30.040 --> 19:33.120
Those who trampled on me
must pay for what they did.

19:33.200 --> 19:34.320
I have to see it.

19:34.400 --> 19:36.000
Until then, even in death,

19:36.680 --> 19:38.120
I won't rest in peace.

19:41.680 --> 19:42.960
Are you sure?

19:47.120 --> 19:48.120
Very well.

19:51.040 --> 19:55.240
Do you know
why I provoked Lady Zheng today?

19:57.640 --> 20:00.520
First, to get us out of there quickly.

20:01.040 --> 20:02.000
Second,

20:04.200 --> 20:05.360
who do you think

20:06.280 --> 20:08.600
most longs for the Emperor's death?

20:09.680 --> 20:12.320
The Crown Prince and his mother.

20:14.320 --> 20:15.600
The more impatient they are,

20:16.480 --> 20:18.200
the more likely they are to make mistakes.

20:18.920 --> 20:20.600
An ant can hardly topple a great tree,

20:22.120 --> 20:23.600
but termites can hollow it out.

20:25.200 --> 20:26.160
Don't worry.

20:27.200 --> 20:29.160
I won't forget what they did to you.

20:29.880 --> 20:32.800
I won't forget those girls he abused.

20:46.200 --> 20:47.720
Why did avoid your sister?

20:48.800 --> 20:50.840
My sister and I have
only recently become family.

20:50.920 --> 20:52.520
She's far closer to Hongxian than to me.

20:53.040 --> 20:54.840
I only asked to
marry Hongxian to save her,

20:54.920 --> 20:57.600
but she may think
I have an ulterior motive.

20:58.400 --> 20:59.840
You really have feelings for Hongxian?

21:01.360 --> 21:04.040
In this palace, there's every kind
of beauty you can imagine.

21:04.840 --> 21:06.760
My sister has
always kept me at a distance.

21:07.360 --> 21:08.720
Hongxian is her foster sister.

21:09.360 --> 21:12.600
I approached Hongxian
to learn more about my sister's past.

21:13.200 --> 21:14.600
I also wanted to understand

21:14.680 --> 21:17.080
why my sister cared for her so much,
so protective of her.

21:17.920 --> 21:20.440
By chance, it ended
in a marriage arrangement.

21:22.520 --> 21:24.600
Lord Lu, I'll be direct.

21:24.680 --> 21:26.560
I came to say just two things.

21:27.280 --> 21:30.080
First, there's
something uncanny about Yi Jiang.

21:30.160 --> 21:31.120
Her readings are never wrong.

21:31.200 --> 21:33.200
You must warn my sister to be careful.

21:33.280 --> 21:36.640
-I will.
-Second, the Crown Prince…

21:36.720 --> 21:38.720
He's about to make a move.
We should be on our guard.

21:53.880 --> 21:54.800
Forgive me, Your Ladyship.

21:55.520 --> 21:56.360
Get out!

21:57.440 --> 21:58.840
All of you, get out!

21:58.920 --> 22:02.800
BLOSSOMS NESTLED IN DEW

22:11.120 --> 22:14.040
Mother, let me do it.

22:27.320 --> 22:30.600
Wei Rao is arrogant, but she wasn't wrong.

22:31.360 --> 22:32.760
His Majesty's affection has faded.

22:32.840 --> 22:34.240
You've long been out of favor.

22:34.320 --> 22:36.160
Becoming Empress is
now an impossible dream.

22:36.680 --> 22:38.880
You'd do better to
support the Crown Prince.

22:40.040 --> 22:40.920
How dare you!

22:41.520 --> 22:43.120
Who are you to say such things?

22:46.320 --> 22:47.400
In this world,

22:48.440 --> 22:51.280
the Crown Prince
is the only one you can rely on.

22:58.000 --> 23:01.080
Is His Majesty still taking medicine?

23:02.120 --> 23:03.240
Why do you ask?

23:03.920 --> 23:08.520
Wu'an's insolence
has made you ill with distress.

23:08.600 --> 23:10.000
To silence the gossip,

23:10.600 --> 23:13.840
His Majesty will surely visit you often.

23:18.520 --> 23:20.640
When the late Emperor died,

23:21.440 --> 23:23.160
the lives of his consorts

23:23.760 --> 23:25.560
were entirely at
the Empress Dowager's mercy.

23:26.240 --> 23:28.080
Lady Li is in favor
only because of her beauty.

23:28.160 --> 23:29.520
How long can her good fortune last?

23:31.480 --> 23:34.160
Your Ladyship, just keep your composure

23:35.040 --> 23:36.800
and be patient.

23:46.720 --> 23:48.000
Say no more.

23:50.240 --> 23:51.720
Let me think it over.

23:52.520 --> 23:55.120
Are you sure you can persuade Mother?

23:56.040 --> 23:58.400
Who could resist the chance

23:58.480 --> 24:00.920
to wield power in Weiyang Palace

24:01.000 --> 24:03.240
and hold all of Chang'an in their grasp?

24:04.200 --> 24:05.360
HENGCHENG GATE

24:05.440 --> 24:06.520
Lord Han,

24:07.200 --> 24:08.840
what did the Empress Dowager say?

24:09.680 --> 24:12.320
She deeply resents all
three of the Zhou family.

24:12.400 --> 24:13.520
The plan will certainly work.

24:14.120 --> 24:15.120
However…

24:15.960 --> 24:17.080
Once we succeed,

24:17.160 --> 24:19.920
the Crown Prince will strip
the Lu family of military power,

24:20.000 --> 24:22.040
promote you to General-in-Chief,

24:22.120 --> 24:24.680
and give your family
back its lands and title.

24:25.320 --> 24:26.480
Good.

24:28.000 --> 24:30.600
The Han family will serve the Crown Prince

24:30.680 --> 24:33.400
and gladly give our lives for him.

24:38.600 --> 24:40.400
How do you plan to deal with Wei Rao?

24:41.000 --> 24:44.640
Noble Lady Wu'an saves those in peril
and is widely revered.

24:45.160 --> 24:46.960
Zhuyu Estate has become a haven.

24:49.680 --> 24:51.200
But branches can
grow too heavy for a tree,

24:51.280 --> 24:52.240
and an estate too large to control.

24:52.840 --> 24:54.280
Her greatest strength

24:54.360 --> 24:58.760
will also be her fatal weakness.

25:04.440 --> 25:05.560
ZHAO

25:05.640 --> 25:10.200
Nice!

25:10.280 --> 25:11.440
Go, General Qi!

25:11.520 --> 25:12.560
-Nice blow!
-Go, General Qi!

25:12.640 --> 25:13.640
Go, General Qi!

25:13.720 --> 25:16.160
-Come on.
-Go, General Qi!

25:16.240 --> 25:19.880
Yes!

25:19.960 --> 25:22.440
-Go, General Qi!
-Go, General Qi!

25:22.520 --> 25:23.800
-General Qi!
-Well done!

25:23.880 --> 25:25.000
Go, General Qi!

25:25.600 --> 25:26.560
Keep it up!

25:26.640 --> 25:28.800
Nice!

25:28.880 --> 25:29.880
General Qi!

25:29.960 --> 25:31.360
-Go, General Qi!
-Wonderful!

25:31.440 --> 25:32.600
-Nice blow!
-Keep going!

25:32.680 --> 25:34.880
-General Qi!
-General Qi!

25:34.960 --> 25:36.760
-I'll spar with you!
-Go, General Qi!

25:36.840 --> 25:37.840
That's our General Qi!

25:41.880 --> 25:48.080
-Victory!
-Victory!

25:48.160 --> 25:49.400
General Qi will win!

25:49.480 --> 25:55.520
-You'll win!
-You'll win!

25:58.800 --> 26:00.440
General Qi will win!

26:00.520 --> 26:04.800
Victory!

26:05.760 --> 26:07.400
Great moves, General Qi!

26:07.480 --> 26:11.920
-Nice!
-Fantastic!

26:12.000 --> 26:15.320
Victory!

26:15.400 --> 26:16.440
Great moves, General Lu!

26:16.520 --> 26:18.120
Victory!

26:18.200 --> 26:20.080
What are you staring at?
Don't you have drills to do?

26:20.680 --> 26:22.120
Move along! Break it up!

26:22.200 --> 26:23.840
-Let's go. Come on.
-Let's go. Come on.

26:23.920 --> 26:25.720
-That was quite a fight!
-It was.

26:25.800 --> 26:27.320
-They're far better than us.
-They are.

26:27.400 --> 26:28.560
General Qi was incredible.

26:55.640 --> 26:56.520
Qi Zhongkai, what's wrong with you?

26:56.600 --> 26:58.120
You smell like her incense.

26:58.640 --> 26:59.760
You're clearly showing off.

26:59.840 --> 27:01.160
I should've hit you a few more times.

27:01.240 --> 27:02.360
I'm not.

27:08.800 --> 27:11.520
Perhaps the maids
used it to scent my clothes.

27:11.600 --> 27:13.120
Who do you think you're fooling?

27:17.760 --> 27:18.920
Qi Zhongkai.

27:19.600 --> 27:20.640
Zhongkai!

27:21.800 --> 27:24.920
How long are you going to stay angry?

27:30.400 --> 27:32.960
My Lord, Zhuyu Estate is taking
in refugees this morning.

27:35.760 --> 27:36.960
Have the horses prepared.

27:48.840 --> 27:49.920
ZHUYU ESTATE

27:50.000 --> 27:51.200
Keep moving.

27:51.280 --> 27:52.680
Give us your name.

27:54.000 --> 27:54.680
-All right, go ahead.
-Move along. Go ahead.

27:54.760 --> 27:55.880
-Move along.
-Go ahead.

27:57.200 --> 27:58.560
-Move along. Come on.
-Line up!

27:58.640 --> 27:59.640
Step up here. Line up!

28:03.040 --> 28:05.240
Once you've registered,
move ahead. There's food up front.

28:06.920 --> 28:07.760
Off you go.

28:12.200 --> 28:14.680
-Don't rush. One at a time.
-There's enough for everyone.

28:14.760 --> 28:15.760
Here you are.

28:15.840 --> 28:17.280
Keep moving at the back.

28:19.880 --> 28:21.360
-Lodgings are over there.
-All right, next.

28:21.440 --> 28:23.320
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

28:23.400 --> 28:24.560
-Keep moving.
-Here.

28:24.640 --> 28:26.520
-Here you are.
-Thank you!

28:26.600 --> 28:28.080
-Thank you.
-Be careful. It's hot.

28:28.680 --> 28:29.840
Here you are.

28:30.440 --> 28:31.480
-There's enough for everyone.
-Here.

28:31.560 --> 28:32.720
Keep moving at the back.

28:32.800 --> 28:33.640
Here.

28:34.160 --> 28:35.200
-Give me some.
-Here's yours.

28:35.280 --> 28:36.240
Is the child ill?

28:36.800 --> 28:40.160
Your Ladyship, my granddaughter is sick.

28:40.240 --> 28:41.120
Those at the back!

28:41.200 --> 28:43.280
Please bless her.

28:43.360 --> 28:45.080
-There's more over here.
-Don't believe the rumors.

28:45.600 --> 28:46.840
I'm only human.

28:47.440 --> 28:49.000
If your child is ill,
take her to a physician.

28:53.920 --> 28:55.480
Don't touch her!

29:07.920 --> 29:09.720
A spring epidemic
has broken out in Ancheng.

29:09.800 --> 29:10.880
Countless people have fallen ill
or died in the past half month.

29:11.840 --> 29:14.760
Prince Fu ordered the city gates shut.
These people fled from Ancheng.

29:16.120 --> 29:19.520
That's not true! No!

29:21.240 --> 29:22.280
What's wrong?

29:22.360 --> 29:23.840
What happened?

29:23.920 --> 29:25.040
Wake up!

29:31.400 --> 29:32.320
Take them away.

29:32.400 --> 29:34.840
Some great savior you are!

29:34.920 --> 29:37.040
My granddaughter is dying,

29:37.120 --> 29:40.040
yet you heartlessly turn us away!

29:40.640 --> 29:43.480
What kind of living saint are you?

29:43.560 --> 29:47.760
You're a murderer,
a demon who brings death!

29:47.840 --> 29:49.280
Look, everyone! She's a murderous demon!

29:49.360 --> 29:50.760
There's nothing kind about her!

29:50.840 --> 29:53.200
-And people think she's a living saint.
-Zhao Song.

29:53.280 --> 29:55.760
She makes me sick!

29:55.840 --> 29:56.800
She's cruel and vicious.

29:56.880 --> 29:59.040
-Don't let her fool you!
-You monster!

29:59.120 --> 30:01.720
You let infected people in.
Are you trying to kill everyone?

30:03.320 --> 30:04.960
-Who told you to do this?
-Qi Zhongkai,

30:05.600 --> 30:06.880
this isn't the place.

30:07.560 --> 30:08.720
Take him away.

30:11.680 --> 30:12.960
I… I don't know anything!

30:13.040 --> 30:14.520
I really don't!

30:16.240 --> 30:18.640
The illness comes on quickly
and hits hard.

30:18.720 --> 30:20.280
Ancheng is so far away.

30:20.840 --> 30:22.400
How could they have made it here on foot?

30:22.960 --> 30:24.400
Someone clearly brought them in carriages.

30:25.440 --> 30:26.440
Detain them.

30:26.520 --> 30:28.360
Check everyone again.

30:28.440 --> 30:30.800
Look for anyone with a pale
or bluish face, trembling hands or feet,

30:30.880 --> 30:33.680
fever, or convulsions.
Don't miss a single one.

30:33.760 --> 30:34.960
Have them leave.

30:35.480 --> 30:36.360
Yes.

30:36.880 --> 30:38.400
-Murderous demon!
-Hurry!

30:38.480 --> 30:40.000
-Murderous demon!
-Move! Hurry!

30:40.080 --> 30:41.520
Out! Get out!

30:42.320 --> 30:43.440
-Hurry!
-Get out!

30:43.960 --> 30:45.080
-Hurry!
-Out!

30:45.160 --> 30:46.280
Move!

30:46.360 --> 30:47.200
Hurry!

30:47.280 --> 30:50.480
-Murderous demon!
-Get out!

30:51.680 --> 30:52.800
Move along!

30:52.880 --> 30:53.840
Move!

30:55.280 --> 30:56.320
-Hurry!
-Move!

30:56.920 --> 30:58.800
-Move!
-Why aren't you stopping her?

30:59.400 --> 31:00.840
You can't stop her.

31:00.920 --> 31:01.840
Just stay out of her way.

31:04.520 --> 31:05.520
Don't cry.

31:06.160 --> 31:07.600
I'll buy you some sweets.

31:13.240 --> 31:14.400
Everyone, stay calm.

31:14.480 --> 31:17.200
Anyone who's ill must have
their symptoms recorded accurately.

31:17.720 --> 31:19.440
I'll set up quarters for the sick,

31:20.040 --> 31:23.080
provide food and water every day,
and send physicians and medicinal herbs.

31:24.040 --> 31:27.280
With proper care,
everyone will be well again.

31:28.720 --> 31:32.280
-Thank you, Your Ladyship!
-Thank you, Your Ladyship!

31:33.000 --> 31:34.200
Now that you've come here,

31:34.840 --> 31:37.200
you're my people
and deserve my protection.

31:38.200 --> 31:39.800
Take the child to a physician.

31:41.160 --> 31:42.240
Thank you.

31:43.600 --> 31:45.480
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

31:46.120 --> 31:47.680
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

31:47.760 --> 31:49.040
Her Ladyship acts by Heaven's will,

31:49.120 --> 31:51.560
saving lives and
easing the people's suffering.

31:51.640 --> 31:53.560
May Heaven protect Her Ladyship,

31:53.640 --> 31:56.320
and may her kindness
bless the entire realm!

31:59.200 --> 32:05.040
May Heaven bless Her Ladyship
with good fortune and a long life!

32:05.120 --> 32:09.920
May she live long
and bless all the people!

32:10.000 --> 32:11.000
Everyone, get up!

32:13.040 --> 32:15.480
Please stop kneeling! Get up!

32:18.680 --> 32:20.240
Aman, go into the city

32:20.320 --> 32:22.240
and bring every physician
skilled in treating epidemics.

32:22.320 --> 32:23.360
Hurry.

32:23.440 --> 32:24.320
Yes.

32:25.920 --> 32:28.040
-Line up!
-Form a line!

32:28.120 --> 32:29.560
-Get in line!
-Hurry!

32:29.640 --> 32:31.520
-Line up!
-One at a time!

32:32.040 --> 32:33.160
Unbelievable.

32:33.760 --> 32:36.040
People keep exploiting
her kindness to cause trouble,

32:36.120 --> 32:37.880
only to help her rise even higher.

32:37.960 --> 32:38.960
What's so surprising?

32:39.560 --> 32:43.360
I imagine whoever's behind this
must be furious right now.

32:43.440 --> 32:46.200
I don't know whether they're furious.

32:46.280 --> 32:50.000
All I know is
you two scared me half to death.

33:04.560 --> 33:07.680
Turning everything to her advantage.

33:08.920 --> 33:10.880
that is who she truly is.

33:25.200 --> 33:26.040
Stop.

33:26.120 --> 33:27.960
You'd better tell the truth

33:28.480 --> 33:29.880
and spare yourself more pain.

33:29.960 --> 33:33.120
I was only trying to help
by letting them into the estate.

33:33.200 --> 33:35.920
How was I to know
which people had the plague?

33:36.000 --> 33:38.240
I really don't know anything.

33:38.320 --> 33:40.400
I'm innocent!

33:41.280 --> 33:42.520
Stubborn, aren't you?

33:44.400 --> 33:47.160
You won't talk unless we torture you.

33:47.240 --> 33:48.200
Qi Zhongkai!

33:54.960 --> 33:56.880
Don't bother. Take him out.

33:58.200 --> 34:00.080
Lu Zhuo, you're letting him go?

34:08.920 --> 34:12.400
Thank you, Lord Lu, for giving me justice.

34:12.480 --> 34:14.440
I'll never forget your kindness.

34:14.520 --> 34:15.760
Lu Zhuo!

34:15.840 --> 34:18.679
Since we can't get anything out of him,
why waste time?

34:20.360 --> 34:22.159
Let the people decide his fate.

34:23.440 --> 34:26.040
Whether he's torn apart by chariots
or stoned to death

34:26.120 --> 34:27.560
will depend on his luck.

34:27.639 --> 34:29.239
-Lord… Lord Lu!
-Take him away.

34:29.320 --> 34:31.679
Lord Lu!

34:31.760 --> 34:33.480
I really don't know anything!

34:33.560 --> 34:35.199
Lord Lu, I'll talk!

34:39.639 --> 34:41.080
Lord Lu, I'll talk.

34:41.159 --> 34:44.560
Someone gave me two gold pellets
and told me

34:45.320 --> 34:46.800
to let them in.

34:47.679 --> 34:49.880
But I didn't recognize him.

34:49.960 --> 34:52.199
I'd never seen him before.

34:52.280 --> 34:53.840
I've told you everything I know.

34:53.920 --> 34:55.880
Spare me, Lord Lu! Spare me!

34:55.960 --> 34:57.960
Give him 50 strokes of
the rod and hold him for now.

34:58.560 --> 35:00.680
Lord Lu, I told you everything. Please!

35:00.760 --> 35:02.880
Lord Lu!

35:02.960 --> 35:04.280
I should've known.

35:04.800 --> 35:08.320
Who but that petty Crown Prince,
who's unworthy of his position,

35:08.400 --> 35:10.960
would do something so vile?

35:12.600 --> 35:15.240
General Qi,
you're no longer angry with me?

35:17.760 --> 35:19.160
I can do the math too.

35:19.680 --> 35:21.920
Falling out with
you would cost me two friends.

35:22.520 --> 35:23.960
I won't make such a bad bargain.

35:24.800 --> 35:28.200
I've sworn
to find someone better than Wei Rao.

35:28.880 --> 35:34.280
My wife
must surpass her in both wit and virtue.

35:34.960 --> 35:39.400
Otherwise, I'd rather never marry
than settle for any less.

35:41.160 --> 35:42.320
I'm leaving.

35:53.400 --> 35:57.400
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

36:22.880 --> 36:25.480
Don't worry, Rao.
I'll treat Hongxian well.

36:25.560 --> 36:27.880
In three days,
I'll bring her back to see you.

36:53.840 --> 36:55.200
When a girl marries,

36:56.120 --> 36:57.680
her brother helps her into the carriage.

36:58.280 --> 36:59.800
Your own brother is good for nothing,

36:59.880 --> 37:01.600
I sent him to the army to be tempered.

37:03.000 --> 37:05.320
Today, let Xiao help you instead.

37:06.160 --> 37:07.800
It's for good luck.

37:10.000 --> 37:10.880
Come here.

37:23.720 --> 37:24.640
Go on.

39:07.080 --> 39:08.560
Hongxian is of humble birth.

39:08.640 --> 39:11.280
She'll have to settle for the rank now.

39:12.360 --> 39:14.640
Once she's had a child in a year or two,

39:15.320 --> 39:18.000
you can ask
His Majesty to grant her a title.

39:18.080 --> 39:20.320
Then she'll have
a bright future ahead of her.

39:22.240 --> 39:24.440
Don't worry. Let's go inside.

39:35.240 --> 39:37.640
My Lord, why don't you go over?

39:38.520 --> 39:40.720
It's all right. Let's go.

40:23.400 --> 40:25.040
It's beautiful.

40:33.880 --> 40:36.920
You've kept forcing my hand.

40:37.000 --> 40:38.440
Don't blame me for what comes next.

40:40.120 --> 40:41.880
But I mustn't act rashly.

40:43.000 --> 40:44.080
Wei Rao,

40:44.880 --> 40:46.560
stay calm

40:54.120 --> 40:55.280
Did I wake you?

40:58.680 --> 41:00.720
-I wanted to say…
-I know.

41:04.360 --> 41:05.680
You know what I want to say?

41:07.280 --> 41:10.400
You want to say,
with sick refugees entering the capital,

41:11.160 --> 41:13.040
Grandfather and
Grandmother getting on in years,

41:13.120 --> 41:16.480
you plan to move to the estate
as a precaution.

41:19.840 --> 41:20.680
And you agree?

41:23.040 --> 41:24.360
I'll move there with you.

41:25.240 --> 41:26.840
We'll tell the elders together tomorrow.

41:31.200 --> 41:32.440
What I meant was…

41:32.520 --> 41:34.000
I joined the army at thirteen

41:35.040 --> 41:36.680
and crossed countless dangerous lands.

41:36.760 --> 41:39.400
I've seen plenty
of deadly fevers and plagues.

41:39.920 --> 41:41.520
I have more experience handling them.

41:42.480 --> 41:43.600
That's one reason.

41:43.680 --> 41:45.520
An epidemic spreads rapidly.

41:45.600 --> 41:46.720
From one person,

41:46.800 --> 41:49.000
it can spread to a household,
a village, then a whole town

41:49.680 --> 41:51.040
in just two months.

41:52.200 --> 41:53.960
Whoever let
infected people into the capital

41:55.080 --> 41:56.200
isn't merely targeting you.

41:58.520 --> 42:00.640
They may have some other scheme in mind.

42:01.520 --> 42:02.560
I must stay vigilant.

42:03.280 --> 42:05.040
Someone wants to
throw the capital into chaos?

42:05.120 --> 42:06.000
What's more…

42:11.160 --> 42:12.400
Let's sleep.

42:12.480 --> 42:14.480
You haven't told me your third reason.

42:21.120 --> 42:22.120
I can't bear to be apart from you.

42:28.720 --> 42:30.160
Lu Zhuo, I want to…

42:30.240 --> 42:31.520
Whatever you're planning,

42:32.640 --> 42:33.520
don't tell me.

42:35.960 --> 42:38.040
I serve the Emperor
and owe him my loyalty.

42:38.560 --> 42:41.120
There are some things
I'm better off not knowing.

42:43.200 --> 42:44.440
Whatever you want to do,

42:44.960 --> 42:46.280
go ahead and do it.

42:47.080 --> 42:50.040
All my men are yours to command.

42:52.360 --> 42:53.400
Really?

42:58.720 --> 43:00.360
Then I'm going to do something

43:01.800 --> 43:03.920
that will shake the realm.

45:16.120 --> 45:18.840
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
